    VERCEL -->|Loads website · HTTPS| CLIENT
    CLIENT <-->|Sign-in · read & write records| FIREBASE
    PI <-->|Reads & updates records and alerts| FIREBASE
    PI -->|Sends machine alerts| FCM
    FCM -->|Push notifications to the owner's Android app| CLIENT
    PI <-->|Controls| HARDWARE
    CLIENT <-->|Secure requests · HTTPS / ID token| TUNNEL
    TUNNEL <-->|Public Pi API| PI
